{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sd-04-strategic-brief/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T23:58:49.113Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"3f3e4ac4eb189cce2e8bc2cab470fb27d60785d3beebaca0aeffd62b598c78da","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","text":"Ruth Calloway, I couldn't set up the 07:45 daily brief. The scheduler refused my request because the gateway needs credentials, so nothing is scheduled and no brief will post tomorrow unless that's fixed. Gideon, Nadia and you are in all three channels, so the content itself is fine to summarise here. If an admin fixes the scheduler access, I'll set it up for 07:45 Central daily. Until then, ask me in this channel and I'll post a brief on demand.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000125"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","ts":"1791986400.000126","thread_ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
